योग (गः) 1.
m. Junction; meeting;
abstraction of mind, devotion;
manner of performing it; fitness.

योग-क्षेम (मः) 1.
m. Charge of goods;
insurance; profit; welfare, weal;
articles not^1 divisible among^2 heirs.
